FINAL PRODUCT PRINCIPLE

StudyHub Smart Study Planner must be a reliable, explainable, self-improving rule-based planning system, not an AI chatbot disguised as a planner.

Rules guarantee safety. Historical data improves estimates. The adaptive scheduler creates realistic plans. Validation prevents bad output. The user retains control.

The ultimate goal is not to generate the largest number of tasks. It is to help each student decide what to study next, allocate realistic time, and steadily improve the quality of future plans using trustworthy evidence.

Implement this within the existing StudyHub application while preserving all unrelated features and existing user data.